g the core version, but we can cross that bridge when we come to it.\r\n\r\nAll imo, I don't know if any other core guys want to weigh in.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112470#pullrequestreview-4821821540","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112470","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-30T18:03:06Z"}]